  "Name": "Doodle Jump",
  "Overview": "Doodle Jump for Kinect brings the climbing game to Xbox Live Arcade with full-body controls. Step sideways to guide the bouncing Doodler from platform to platform, point to shoot at monsters, and flap your arms to fly when the game calls for it. This version introduces three worlds, boss encounters, and power-ups designed around motion controls. Each climb challenges players to collect stars and keep rising past monsters, black holes, and gaps.",
